ent-GeneticBodyGrower = genetic body grower
    .desc = A sealed biocapsule for growing donor bodies. Behind the thick glass, the nutrient medium gradually takes on a human shape. Or something close to one.
ent-GeneticBodyGrowerMachineCircuitboard = genetic body grower machine board
    .desc = A biocapsule control board. Its circuitry maintains the delicate conditions in which a few cells can develop into an entire body.
ent-GeneticSampleCartridge = genetic sample cartridge
    .desc = A sealed cartridge with a built-in sampler. It can take a sample from a living donor or an extracted brain with preserved DNA. There is space for the donor's name on the label.
